%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "flowchart": {"wrappingWidth": 220}, "sequence": {"wrap": true, "width": 170, "useMaxWidth": false}}}%%
flowchart TB
    S1[Source code] --> C1[Compiler with ASan or TSan]
    C1 --> B1[Instrumented executable]
    B1 --> N1[Direct native execution plus sanitizer runtime]

    B2[Ordinary executable] --> V[Valgrind core]
    V --> X[Decode executed machine-code blocks]
    X --> IR[Translate to Valgrind intermediate representation]
    IR --> TI[Memcheck or Helgrind adds instrumentation]
    TI --> HC[Generate and cache host machine code]
    HC --> N2[Execute translated instrumented code on the real CPU]
